			"notes": "- Add support for 26.4 Snapshot 10.\n- Correct the links in \"fabric.mod.json\".\n- Add static methods to \"SavedConfig\".\n    - Static methods receive a config class and operate on its static fields.\n        - The config class doesn't have to implement SavedConfig.\n        - The config class can use \"@SavedConfig.Path\".\n- Add static and non-static methods to \"SavedConfig\".\n    - Add \"serialize\".\n        - Converts the config into a \"JsonObject\".\n    - Add \"deserialize\".\n        - Converts a \"JsonObject\" into the config.\n    - Add \"save\".\n        - Saves the config to a file.\n        - Can receive a Path or String instead of using the annotation.\n        - Already existed as non-static using annotation.\n    - Add \"load\".\n        - Loads the config from a file.\n        - Can receive a Path or String instead of using the annotation.\n        - Already existed as non-static using annotation.\n    - Add \"autoSave\".\n        - Saves the config to a file when the game is closed.\n        - Can receive a Path or String instead of using the annotation.\n        - Already existed as non-static using annotation.\n- Add \"SavedConfig.MissingPath\".\n    - Is an \"IllegalStateException\".\n    - Thrown when trying to save a \"SavedConfig\" with no \"SavedConfig.Path\" annotation to a file or load from a file without giving a path."
		},
